;
PUBLIC DISK COMMANDS
CALLER commands, subject to the current access policy.

A - BYE - End your call
B - CHAT - A word with the sysop
C - CLS - Clear the terminal display
D - DIR - List files on a disk
E - HELP - The online help command
F - LDIR - List the members of a library
G - LT - Read text and library members
H - MESSAGE - Leave a note for the sysop
I - MOUNT - Exchanging library disks
J - NDSCAN - Refresh named directories
K - RBBS - The bulletin board and private mail
L - SDZ - Super directory
M - TYPE - Display an ordinary text file
N - UPLOAD - Send files to the sysop
O - YSEND - Download a file using ymodem
